== Installation ==

It's easy to install.

1. Extract `hack_me_if_you_can.zip` and upload the folder `hack_me_if_you_can` to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory;
2. Activate the plugin through the `Plugins` menu in WordPress;
3. Configure plugin

